    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812340/extras/8511ac28cc420abe41630236f20041a6.avif?t=1646423588\" /></div><br>A Visual Novel set in a nautical steampunk universe, Enigmarella is the story of Alice, an orphan, whose life takes an unexpected turn when she is forced into an arranged marriage.<br><br>With multiple paths, and unique endings -where choices really make a huge difference-, Enigmarella is a tale about romance, friendship, fate, mystery, and some strange medical experiments.<br><br>Key Features:<br>-\tFully voiced, immersive experience<br>-\tMasterfully rendered realistic style art<br>-\t16 truly unique endings<br>-\tAwesome original soundtrack by Myuu<br>-\tAnd of course, our lovely, hot-headed, selfish, rebellious anti-heroine: Alice Rahner",
